OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,6,Fwith some spells of sunshine, although
OL,7,Fsome cloud around at times. Cooler
OL,8,Fonshore breeze along the east coast.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FDry this evening. Then the
OL,11,Frest of the night will be largely dry
OL,12,Fwith clear periods. Thicker cloud may
OL,13,Fbring a few showers to the eastern
OL,14,FBorders later.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FA few sunny spells otherwise
OL,17,Frather cloudy at times. Chance of a
OL,18,Ffew showers across Lothians and
OL,19,FBorders, mainly over the hills. Warm
OL,20,Fin the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
